{"target": "html", "code": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Bun - Fast JavaScript Runtime</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Archivo:wdth,wght@62..125,100..900&family=Inter:wght@400;500;700&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <style>\n        body {\n            font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;\n            background-color: #0c0a0b;\n            color: #eae9e8;\n            margin: 0;\n            padding: 0;\n            width: 1536px; /* Explicitly set body width to match target */\n        }\n        .font-archivo {\n            font-family: 'Archivo', sans-serif;\n        }\n        .text-heading {\n            font-size: 67px; /* Adjusted to match cap height and line length */\n            line-height: 1.05; /* Adjusted for tighter line spacing */\n            letter-spacing: -0.01em; /* Adjusted letter spacing */\n            font-weight: 800; /* Archivo Black */\n            font-stretch: 75%; /* Archivo wdth axis */\n        }\n        .text-body {\n            font-size: 17px;\n        }\n        .text-button {\n            font-size: 13px;\n        }\n        .navbar-height {\n            height: 66px;\n        }\n        .button-height {\n            height: 37px;\n        }\n        .bg-primary-dark {\n            background-color: #100a0d;\n        }\n        .text-muted {\n            color: #dbdcdc;\n        }\n        .text-pink-accent {\n            color: #ff007f;\n        }\n        .tab-active {\n            background-color: #1a1a1a;\n            border-bottom: 2px solid #ff007f;\n        }\n        .bar-bun {\n            background-color: #ff007f;\n        }\n        .bar-other {\n            background-color: #333333;\n        }\n        /* Custom colors from target */\n        .bg-target-darkest { background-color: #0c0a0b; }\n        .bg-target-dark { background-color: #141213; }\n        .bg-target-medium { background-color: #1e1c1d; }\n        .bg-target-light { background-color: #242323; }\n        .text-target-light { color: #eae9e8; }\n        .text-target-muted { color: #dbdcdc; }\n        .border-target-light { border-color: #2c2a2b; }\n        .bg-target-bar-bg { background-color: #110f10; }\n        .bg-target-bar-other { background-color: #232122; }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n    <div class=\"min-h-screen bg-target-darkest\">\n        <!-- Banner -->\n        <div class=\"bg-target-dark text-target-muted text-[13px] flex items-center justify-center h-[38px] px-4 w-[1536px]\">\n            Bun has joined Anthropic \u2014 and Anthropic is betting on Bun \u2192\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Navbar -->\n        <header class=\"bg-target-darkest navbar-height border-b border-target-light flex items-center justify-center px-4 w-[1536px]\">\n            <nav class=\"w-[1166px] flex items-center justify-between\">\n                <div class=\"flex items-center space-x-2\">\n                    <!-- Logo -->\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center space-x-2 w-[104px] h-[30px] relative\">\n                        <svg class=\"absolute left-0 top-0\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n                            <path d=\"M12 2C6.47715 2 2 6.47715 2 12C2 17.5228 6.47715 22 12 22C17.5228 22 22 17.5228 22 12C22 6.47715 17.5228 2 12 2Z\" fill=\"#FF007F\"/>\n                            <path d=\"M12 10C10.8954 10 10 10.8954 10 12C10 13.1046 10.8954 14 12 14C13.1046 14 14 13.1046 14 12C14 10.8954 13.1046 10 12 10Z\" fill=\"white\"/>\n                            <path d=\"M16 8C16.5523 8 17 7.55228 17 7C17 6.44772 16.5523 6 16 6C15.4477 6 15 6.44772 15 7C15 7.55228 15.4477 8 16 8Z\" fill=\"white\"/>\n                            <path d=\"M8 8C8.55228 8 9 7.55228 9 7C9 6.44772 8.55228 6 8 6C7.44772 6 7 6.44772 7 7C7 7.55228 7.44772 8 8 8Z\" fill=\"white\"/>\n                        </svg>\n                        <span class=\"font-archivo text-[20px] font-bold absolute left-[30px] top-[3px]\">Bun</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <!-- Menu -->\n                    <div class=\"ml-[48px] flex space-x-6 text-target-muted text-body h-[16px] items-center\">\n                        <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-white\">Docs</a>\n                        <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-white\">Guides</a>\n                        <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-white\">Reference</a>\n                        <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-white\">Blog</a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"flex items-center space-x-4\">\n                    <!-- Search -->\n                    <div class=\"relative w-[418px] h-[37px]\">\n                        <input type=\"text\" placeholder=\"Search docs, APIs, guides...\" class=\"bg-target-medium text-target-muted text-body pl-10 pr-4 py-2 rounded-md w-full h-full focus:outline-none focus:ring-1 focus:ring-[#ff007f]\">\n                        <svg class=\"absolute left-3 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 text-target-muted\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\">\n                            <circle cx=\"11\" cy=\"11\" r=\"8\"></circle>\n                            <line x1=\"21\" y1=\"21\" x2=\"16.65\" y2=\"16.65\"></line>\n                        </svg>\n                        <span class=\"absolute right-3 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 text-target-muted text-[13px] border border-[#333] px-1 rounded\">/</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <!-- Install Button -->\n                    <button class=\"bg-target-medium text-white text-button px-4 rounded-md button-height hover:bg-[#2a2a2a] w-[65px] h-[37px]\">\n                        Install\n                    </button>\n                </div>\n            </nav>\n        </header>\n\n        <main class=\"w-[1166px] mx-auto py-16 flex justify-between absolute top-[104px] left-[184px]\">\n            <!-- Left Section -->\n            <section class=\"w-[485px] h-[480px] absolute left-0 top-[63px]\">\n                <!-- Badge -->\n                <div class=\"flex items-center text-target-muted text-[13px] mb-4 absolute left-0 top-0 w-[217px] h-[16px]\">\n                    <span class=\"bg-[#ff007f] text-white px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full text-[10px] font-bold mr-2\">NEW</span>\n                    BUN V1.4.3 RELEASED\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Hero Heading -->\n                <h1 class=\"font-archivo text-heading mb-6 absolute left-0 top-[44px] w-[485px] h-[177px]\">\n                    Bun is a <span class=\"text-pink-accent\">fast</span> JavaScript runtime & toolkit. All in one.\n                </h1>\n\n                <!-- Paragraph -->\n                <p class=\"text-body text-target-muted leading-relaxed mb-12 absolute left-0 top-[258px] w-[407px] h-[102px]\">\n                    Runtime, package manager, test runner and bundler in a single binary. Use <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-pink-accent hover:underline\">bun install</a> or <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-pink-accent hover:underline\">bun test</a> in an existing Node.js project, or run the whole thing on Bun.\n                </p>\n\n                <!-- Install Command Container -->\n                <div class=\"bg-target-medium rounded-lg p-4 flex items-center justify-between absolute left-0 top-[437px] w-[516px] h-[58px]\">\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center\">\n                        <span class=\"text-pink-accent mr-2 text-[19px] leading-none\">></span>\n                        <span class=\"text-white text-body\">powershell -c \"irm bun.sh/install.ps1|iex\"</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <button class=\"text-target-muted hover:text-white\">\n                        <svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\">\n                            <rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect>\n                            <path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"></path>\n                        </svg>\n                    </button>\n                </div>\n            </section>\n\n            <!-- Right Section - Performance Chart -->\n            <section class=\"w-[558px] h-[415px] bg-target-medium rounded-lg p-6 absolute left-[579px] top-[63px]\">\n                <!-- Tabs -->\n                <div class=\"flex border-b border-target-light mb-4 text-target-muted text-body w-[558px] h-[44px] absolute left-0 top-0\">\n                    <button class=\"px-4 py-2 tab-active text-white w-[120px] h-[44px]\" data-tab=\"bun-install\">bun install</button>\n                    <button class=\"px-4 py-2 hover:text-white w-[90px] h-[44px]\" data-tab=\"express\">Express</button>\n                    <button class=\"px-4 py-2 hover:text-white w-[90px] h-[44px]\" data-tab=\"postgres\">Postgres</button>\n                    <button class=\"px-4 py-2 hover:text-white w-[110px] h-[44px]\" data-tab=\"websockets\">WebSockets</button>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Chart Content -->\n                <div id=\"bun-install-content\" class=\"tab-content absolute left-[24px] top-[68px] w-[510px] h-[323px]\">\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center text-target-muted text-[13px] mb-4\">\n                        <svg class=\"mr-1\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M8 5v14l11-7z\"/></svg>\n                        replay in real time\n                    </div>\n                    <h3 class=\"text-body font-semibold mb-2\">Installing a Next.js app</h3>\n                    <p class=\"text-target-muted text-[13px] mb-6\">warm cache \u00b7 seconds (lower is better)</p>\n\n                    <div class=\"space-y-6\">\n                        <!-- Bun Bar -->\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center\">\n                            <div class=\"w-[100px] text-target-muted text-[13px]\">\n                                <span class=\"text-white\">bun</span><br>v1.4\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"flex-grow relative h-6 bg-target-bar-bg rounded-sm mr-4\">\n                                <div class=\"bar-bun h-full rounded-sm w-[5%]\"></div>\n                                <div class=\"absolute top-1/2 left-[5%] -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2\">\n                                    <svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n                                        <path d=\"M12 2C6.47715 2 2 6.47715 2 12C2 17.5228 6.47715 22 12 22C17.5228 22 22 17.5228 22 12C22 6.47715 17.5228 2 12 2Z\" fill=\"#FF007F\"/>\n                                        <path d=\"M12 10C10.8954 10 10 10.8954 10 12C10 13.1046 10.8954 14 12 14C13.1046 14 14 13.1046 14 12C14 10.8954 13.1046 10 12 10Z\" fill=\"white\"/>\n                                        <path d=\"M16 8C16.5523 8 17 7.55228 17 7C17 6.44772 16.5523 6 16 6C15.4477 6 15 6.44772 15 7C15 7.55228 15.4477 8 16 8Z\" fill=\"white\"/>\n                                        <path d=\"M8 8C8.55228 8 9 7.55228 9 7C9 6.44772 8.55228 6 8 6C7.44772 6 7 6.44772 7 7C7 7.55228 7.44772 8 8 8Z\" fill=\"white\"/>\n                                    </svg>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                            <span class=\"text-white font-bold text-body w-[60px] text-right\">0.21s</span>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <!-- Yarn Bar -->\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center\">\n                            <div class=\"w-[100px] text-target-muted text-[13px]\">\n                                yarn<br>v1.22.22\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"flex-grow relative h-6 bg-target-bar-bg rounded-sm mr-4\">\n                                <div class=\"bg-target-bar-other h-full rounded-sm w-[35%]\"></div>\n                            </div>\n                            <span class=\"text-white font-bold text-body w-[60px] text-right\">1.76s</span>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <!-- pnpm Bar -->\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center\">\n                            <div class=\"w-[100px] text-target-muted text-[13px]\">\n                                pnpm<br>v11.21.0\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"flex-grow relative h-6 bg-target-bar-bg rounded-sm mr-4\">\n                                <div class=\"bg-target-bar-other h-full rounded-sm w-[38%]\"></div>\n                            </div>\n                            <span class=\"text-white font-bold text-body w-[60px] text-right\">1.92s</span>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <!-- npm Bar -->\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center\">\n                            <div class=\"w-[100px] text-target-muted text-[13px]\">\n                                npm<br>v12.0.2\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"flex-grow relative h-6 bg-target-bar-bg rounded-sm mr-4\">\n                                <div class=\"bg-target-bar-other h-full rounded-sm w-[89%]\"></div>\n                            </div>\n                            <span class=\"text-white font-bold text-body w-[60px] text-right\">4.45s</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- X-axis labels -->\n                    <div class=\"flex justify-between text-target-muted text-[13px] mt-4 px-[100px] w-[410px] absolute left-[24px] top-[270px]\">\n                        <span>0s</span>\n                        <span>1s</span>\n                        <span>2s</span>\n                        <span>3s</span>\n                        <span>4s</span>\n                        <span>5s</span>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <p class=\"text-target-muted text-[13px] mt-8 leading-relaxed absolute left-[24px] top-[308px] w-[510px] h-[69px]\">\n                        T3-stack app, 25 direct dependencies, ~220 packages in the lockfile \u00b7 warm cache \u00b7 lockfile present \u00b7 node_modules removed \u00b7 Linux x64, EPYC 9R14 \u00b7 every package manager at defaults \u00b7 medians of 3\n                        <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-pink-accent hover:underline ml-2\">reproduce</a>\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n                <!-- Other tab contents would go here, hidden by default -->\n            </section>\n        </main>\n    </div>\n\n    <script>\n        document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {\n            const tabs = document.querySelectorAll('[data-tab]');\n            const tabContents = document.querySelectorAll('.tab-content');\n\n            tabs.forEach(tab => {\n                tab.addEventListener('click', () => {\n                    tabs.forEach(t => {\n                        t.classList.remove('tab-active', 'text-white');\n                        t.classList.add('hover:text-white');\n                    });\n                    tab.classList.add('tab-active', 'text-white');\n                    tab.classList.remove('hover:text-white');\n\n                    tabContents.forEach(content => content.style.display = 'none');\n                    document.getElementById(tab.dataset.tab + '-content').style.display = 'block';\n                });\n            });\n\n            // Initially show the first tab content\n            if (tabs.length > 0) {\n                tabs[0].click();\n            }\n        });\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "notes": ["Refined against its own render; headline font found by pixel matching (Archivo, condensed).", "The font for the main heading \"Bun is a fast JavaScript runtime & toolkit. All in one.\" was identified as Archivo with a specific weight (800) and font-stretch (75%) to match the visual appearance. Th", "Absolute positioning and explicit widths/heights were used for many elements to precisely match the target's geometry, as the original layout had significant deviations.", "Custom color classes were added for the background and text colors to match the exact hex values provided in the pixel analysis."], "source": "ai", "provider": {"name": "google-gemini", "model": "gemini-2.5-flash"}, "change": null, "size": {"width": 1536, "height": 674}}